{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like Terraria, you can try this game. It will bring you a different experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Introduction</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568620/extras/77d9ad69ac156268be1a540929c98fe0.avif?t=1757099024\" data-has-big width=800 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connection: Currently you can connect via Steam or LAN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568620/extras/ec5d22e30096a5aa081c66a59b07e883.avif?t=1757099024\" data-has-big width=800 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat: Including melee weapons, long-range weapons, staff summons, and other weapons. Currently, it contains 30 common monsters and 5 bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568620/extras/6f4b8dd985d920c08be7415b679333a5.avif?t=1757099024\" data-has-big width=800 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planting: Plant various crops. Currently there are more than 10 plants that can be planted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568620/extras/3c81e85540d2005ac87169d9ac06daf8.avif?t=1757099024\" data-has-big width=800 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration: Currently includes villages, forests, dungeons, oceans and other landforms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collection: Items dropped by monsters, collected items, mined items, and synthesized items are worth collecting. There are currently 350 items of various types.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construction: Build a camp to accommodate the arrival of NPCs. Currently, wooden houses, wooden tables, and wooden chairs can be built. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feedback</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568620/extras/e7e6708bcd9dbfd1e8754ff16677b829.avif?t=1757099024\" width=558 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple feedback channels are available on the game homepage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568620/extras/f778661e59ed5871395d103cd62af077.avif?t=1757099024\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An anonymous feedback tool is built into the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We appreciate the sharp criticism more than positive reviews.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2568620?t=1757099024","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2568620?t=1757099024","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568620/60a7ac604905a1ded0d568e18efe49659c440c98/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757099024","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568620/60a7ac604905a1ded0d568e18